  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Parable of the Wedding Banquet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus spoke to them again in parables, saying:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"The kingdom of heaven is like a king who prepared a wedding banquet for his son.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He sent his servants to those who had been invited to the banquet to tell them to come, but they refused to come.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Then he sent some more servants and said, 'Tell those who have been invited that I have prepared my dinner: My oxen and fattened cattle have been butchered, and everything is ready. Come to the wedding banquet.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"But they paid no attention and went off—one to his field, another to his business.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The rest seized his servants, mistreated them and killed them.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The king was enraged. He sent his army and destroyed those murderers and burned their city.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Then he said to his servants, 'The wedding banquet is ready, but those I invited did not deserve to come.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "So go to the street corners and invite to the banquet anyone you find.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "So the servants went out into the streets and gathered all the people they could find, the bad as well as the good, and the wedding hall was filled with guests.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"But when the king came in to see the guests, he noticed a man there who was not wearing wedding clothes.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He asked, 'How did you get in here without wedding clothes, friend?' The man was speechless.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Then the king told the attendants, 'Tie him hand and foot, and throw him outside, into the darkness, where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"For many are invited, but few are chosen.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paying the Imperial Tax to Caesar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Pharisees went out and laid plans to trap him in his words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They sent their disciples to him along with the Herodians. \"Teacher,\" they said, \"we know that you are a man of integrity and that you teach the way of God in accordance with the truth. You aren't swayed by others, because you pay no attention to who they are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell us then, what is your opinion? Is it right to pay the imperial tax",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "to Caesar or not?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus, knowing their evil intent, said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"You hypocrites, why are you trying to trap me?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Show me the coin used for paying the tax.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They brought him a denarius,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he asked them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Whose image is this? And whose inscription?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Caesar's,\" they replied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAT 22:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Then he said to them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"So give back to Caesar what is Caesar's, and to God what is God's.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they heard this, they were amazed. So they left him and went away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Marriage at the Resurrection",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That same day the Sadducees, who say there is no resurrection, came to him with a question.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Teacher,\" they said, \"Moses told us that if a man dies without having children, his brother must marry the widow and raise up offspring for him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now there were seven brothers among us. The first one married and died, and since he had no children, he left his wife to his brother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The same thing happened to the second and third brother, right on down to the seventh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Finally, the woman died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now then, at the resurrection, whose wife will she be of the seven, since all of them were married to her?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus replied,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"You are in error because you do not know the Scriptures or the power of God.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "At the resurrection people will neither marry nor be given in marriage; they will be like the angels in heaven.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But about the resurrection of the dead—have you not read what God said to you,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'I am the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "? He is not the God of the dead but of the living.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the crowds heard this, they were astonished at his teaching.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Greatest Commandment",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearing that Jesus had silenced the Sadducees, the Pharisees got together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them, an expert in the law, tested him with this question:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Teacher, which is the greatest commandment in the Law?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus replied:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\" 'Love the Lord your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your mind.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.37",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.37"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "This is the first and greatest commandment.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.38",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.38"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "And the second is like it: 'Love your neighbor as yourself.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.39",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.39"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "All the Law and the Prophets hang on these two commandments.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.40",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.40"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Whose Son Is the Messiah?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While the Pharisees were gathered together, Jesus asked them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"What do you think about the Messiah? Whose son is he?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.42",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.42"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAT 22:42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"The son of David,\" they replied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"How is it then that David, speaking by the Spirit, calls him 'Lord'? For he says,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.43",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.43"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\" 'The Lord said to my Lord:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.44",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.44"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 22:44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Sit at my right hand",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.44",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.44"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MAT 22:44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "until I put your enemies",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.44",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.44"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 22:44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "under your feet.\" '",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.44",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.44"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If then David calls him 'Lord,' how can he be his son?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.22.45",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.22.45"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one could say a word in reply, and from that day on no one dared to ask him any more questions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.22.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
